The motions `walk1_subject1.csv` in this directory are from Unitree's LAFAN1 Retargeting
Dataset (https://huggingface.co/datasets/unitreerobotics/LAFAN1_Retargeting_Dataset),
Unitree Robotics' retargeting of the Ubisoft La Forge Animation Dataset ("LAFAN1",
https://github.com/ubisoft/ubisoft-laforge-animation-dataset), (c) 2018 Ubisoft Entertainment.

